uctor.Forinstance,ifyouhaveasingletonmiddlewarethatinjectsa `TimeService`,andthatinturninjectsa `Timer`.Ifeitherofthemisscoped,anerrorwilloccuratruntime.Tosolvethis,neither `TimeService`nor `ITimer`shouldhaveascopedlifetime;theyshouldbeeithertransientorsingleton.¶Thesameissuewilloccurifyouinjectscopedobjectsviathe `Invoke`methodinmiddleware.¶¶¶¶Формынормализациитаблиц,цельнормализации.¶¶Thegoalofnormalizationistoeliminateredundantdataandpreventproblemswheninserting,updating,ordeletingrecords.Eachhighernormalformincludesthepreviousone.Thismeansatableisinagivennormalformonlyifitisalreadyinthepreviousnormalform. (toavoidrepetition).¶¶-FirstNormalForm (1NF) —eachfieldmustcontainonlyasinglevalue,andtheremustbenoduplicaterows.¶¶-SecondNormalForm (2NF) —everynon-keyattributemustdependontheentireprimarykey,notjustpartofitifthekeyiscomposite.¶¶-ThirdNormalForm (3NF) —allnon‑keyattributesshoulddependdirectlyontheprimarykey,notoneachother.¶¶-Boyce-CoddNormalForm (BCNF) -Thekeyattributesofacompositekeymustnotdependonnon-keyattributes.TherequirementsofBCNFapplyonlytotableswithcompositeprimarykeys.Tableswithasimpleprimarykeythatarein 3NFarealsoinBCNF.¶¶-FourthNormalForm (4NF) -Thereshouldbenomultivalueddependenciesinthetable.Forexample,ifyouhaveattributesA,B,andC,whereBandCareindependentofeachotherbutbothdependonA,youshoulddecomposethetableintotwo:A →BandA →C.Anotherexample: \"Student,Course,Hobby\"shouldbesplitintotwotablestoeliminatemultivalueddependencies (Student →CourseandStudent →Hobby).¶¶-FifthNormalForm (5NF) -afterremovingnon-trivialdependencies,thetablecanbedecomposedintosmallertablessothatwhenyoujointhemyougetbacktheoriginaltablewithoutanylossofdata.¶¶¶¶Связитаблиц.¶¶Aone-to-onerelationshipoccurswhenonerecordinatableisassociatedwithonlyonerecordinanothertable.Forexample,apersonandapassport.¶¶Aone-to-manyrelationshipoccurswhenasinglerecordinthefirsttableisrelatedtomanyrecordsinanothertable,buteachrecordinthesecondtableisrelatedtoonlyonerecordinthefirst.Forexample,onetea